    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "USAIR\nSystem Timetable\nEffective May 2, 1989\nNow's The Time\nTo Get Your Vacation\nPlans Off The Ground.\nFlorida\nCalifornia\nBermuda\nBahamas\n© 1989 USAir Group, Inc.\nIncludes Allegheny Commuter and\nselected Piedmont Airlines flights.",
      "The Long And Short Of\nUSA irs Flight System.\nSEATTLE/TACOMA\n• MONTREAL\nPORTLAND\nBURLINGTON\n• EUGENE\n• REDMOND/BEND\nTORONTO\nJFFALO\nILAGARA F\nMEDFORD •\nMINNEAPOLIS ST. PAUL\nJOHNSON C\n•PORTLAND\nMANCHESTER\nBOSTON\nWORCESTER\nPROVIDENCE\nHARTFORD SPRINGFIELD\nLONG ISLAND\nGRAND •\nMILWAUKEE•\nRAPIDE\nTOLEDO•\nCHICAGO (\n• RENO\nCLEVELAND\nPITTSBURGH\nHARRISBURG • PHILADELPICA\nWHEELING\nATLANTIC CITY\n* • BALTIMORE\n•WASHINGTON, D.C.\nSACRAMENTO •\nCONCORDE\n•STOCKTON\nFRANCISCO\n• OAKLAND\n• SAN JOSE\n• FRESNO\nMONTERE\nDENVER,\nKANSAS\nWICHITA\nLAS VEGAS\nBURBANKE\nOS ANGELES\nONTAR PALM SPRINGS\nLONG BEACH ORANGE COUNTY\n• ALBUQUERQUE\nCHAMPAIGN\nCOLUMBUS\nINDIANAPOLIS\n• DAYTON\n• CINCINNATI\nST. LOUIS O\nLOUISVILE HUNTINGTON\n• CHARLESTON\n•LEXINGTON\n• EVANSVILLE Y\nGREENSBORO/WINSTON-SALEM\nIGH POIN\nBRISTOL JOHNSON CITYIS\n• RALEIGH/DURHAM\nKINGSPORT CHARLOTTE\nNASHVILLE ® KNOXVILLE •\nREENVILLE\nPARTANBURI\nMEMPHIS •\nMYRTLB BEACH\nATLANTA\nNEWPORT NEWS WILLIAMSBURG\nNIA BEACH\nSAN DIEGO\n• PHOENIX\nBIRMINGHAM\n•TUCSON\n• DALLAS/FT. WORTH\nJACKSONYIL\n• AUSTIN\nHOUSTON\nEW ORLEANS\nORLANDO\nSAN ANTONIO•\nTAMPA\nFORT MYERS\n• WEST PALM BEACH\nFORT LAUDERDALE/ HOLLYWOOD\nMIAMI\nPEORIA •\nSPRINGFIELD •\nHAMILTON •\nITHACA\nBINGHAMTON\nMIKA COKNING!\nWILKES-BARRE/SCRANTON •\nJAMESTOW\nBRADFORD\nERIE\nFRANKLIN OIL\nCLEVELAND•\nCHICAGO •\nYOUNGSTOW\nAKRON/CATON®\nSOUTHBENT/ WAYNE®\nPITTSBURC\nMORGANTOW\nLATROBE\nSTOWNA\nPARKERSBURG/MARIETTA •\nDECATUR\n• GREENBRIER\nINDIANAPOLIS\nTERRE HAUTE\nRICHMOND •\nLYNCHBURG •\nROANOKE\nGROTON/NEW LONDON\nTE PLAINS •\nONG\nISLAND\nYORK\nALEHEM/EASTON\nPHILADELPHIA/CAMDEN/WILMINGTON\n• ATLANTIC CITY\nYALTIMORE\nSHINGTON. D.C.\n• NEWPORT NEWS\nOWENSBORO •\nORLANDO •\nVERO BEACH/FORT PIERCE •\nALLEGHENY COMMUTER SYSTEM\nTogether, USAir and Allegheny\nCommuter offer more than 2,200\ndaily flights to over 200 cities\nthroughout the U.S. and Canada.\nSo whether you're flying cross-\ncountry or just a short distance,\nwe re the right pair in the air\nUSAIR A\nALLEGHENY\nCOMMUTER"
